# Normalize line endings for the repo: store LF, check out LF everywhere.
# The deployment target is Linux, and this repo was built on Windows — without
# this rule editors on different platforms keep flip-flopping line endings and
# produce whole-file diffs. Binary formats (the example PNGs, fonts, …) are
# left untouched by the `auto` text detection.
* text=auto eol=lf
